{"seq":1,"slug":"the-three-wars","title":"统一三战","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/major-events/the-three-wars","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-danish-and-austrian-wars","title":"普丹与普奥战争","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/major-events/the-three-wars/the-danish-and-austrian-wars","wordCount":1848,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-franco-prussian-war","title":"普法战争","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/major-events/the-three-wars/the-franco-prussian-war","wordCount":1937,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"统一三战\">统一三战</h1><p>三场统一战争，是俾斯麦缔造帝国的根本手段。本章考察这三场战争。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;普丹与普奥战争&quot;——他排除丹麦控制与奥地利领导权的关键两步。第二篇文档讲述&quot;普法战争&quot;,呈现击败法国、催生德意志帝国的决定性一战。</p>\n"}